      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In the context of a two-period crossover study with baseline measurements a graphical method is developed for displaying the dependence of posterior inferences concerning the treatment effect on unavoidable prior beliefs about the 'correct' model. The method is a generalization of the approach developed by Grieve for the corresponding case without baselines."},
